==Description==
The '''Beach Nametag''' is a nametag that could be obtained at Level 14 of the regular [[Surf & Turf Battle Pass]] track. At that Level, it had a cost of {{BeachBalls|410}} or {{Robux|46}} to unlock it, with a total cost of {{BeachBalls|2,460}} or {{Robux|738}}. This item also has had two other costs. First one was the cost before its 20% discount, which had a cost of {{Robux|58}} with a total cost of {{Robux|930}}. The second was the price prior to the [[Surf & Turf Battle Pass]] individual skip cost fix, where it had a total cost of {{Robux|830}}.

The '''Beach Nametag''' blue text with a unique font. Multiple starfish appear on the text. The text is located on a beach with water and the sky visible in the distance. In the top left corner of the background, there is a sun.

